// Service_Data_Governance — Data Governance Layer (layanan, tanpa alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Service_Data_Governance".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Service_Data_Governance.png
// Acuan: fig:service-governance (Subbab IV.2.3, subsec:rincian-kelompok);
//   rincian bebas-tool kelompok baris 6 Tabel layanan_industri, komponen verbatim.
// Sumber edge: munappy2020adhoc (continuous testing and monitoring pada pipeline
//   data), rella2022mlops (data quality dan data governance sebagai area utama
//   DataOps), jain2025integrating (pembagian tanggung jawab data engineering).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Objek yang divalidasi (batas)
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer [icon: download, color: orange, label: "Data Ingestion and Processing Layer"]

Data Governance Layer [icon: book, color: teal] {
  data governance [icon: book]
  data testing [icon: check-square]
  data quality [icon: check-circle]
}

// Konsumen sinyal kualitas (batas)
Observability Layer [icon: eye, color: teal, label: "Observability Layer"]

// Tata kelola menetapkan standar, pengujian menghasilkan skor kualitas
// (rella2022mlops, munappy2020adhoc)
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer > data testing: pemeriksaan pada pipeline
data governance > data testing: standar pengujian
data testing > data quality: skor kualitas
data quality > Observability Layer: metrik kualitas data
